 <h3><u>Aye mere baradar e eemani</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Aye mere baradar e eemani..(2)</p> 
  <p>mat ghayr se apni yaari rakh<br> Aye mere baradar e eemani</p> 
  <p>mat momin se narazi rakh<br> Aye mere baradar e eemani</p> 
  <p>Aye mere baradar e eemani..(2)</p> 
  <p>1. Zehra ko imam e zamana ko<br> mumkin hai isi se sadma ho<br> mat momin se narazi rakh<br> aye mere baradar e eemani</p> 
  <p>2. Jab baat kare na mehram se<br> ya saamne aajaye tere<br> tu apne nigaahe neechi rakh<br> aye mere baradar e eemani</p> 
  <p>3. Aamal o aqaed apni jagah<br> huliya bhi to ho momin jaisa<br> muche kam kar aur daadhi rakh<br> aye mere baradar e eemani</p> 
  <p>4. Nigraa'n hai imam e zamaa'n tujh par<br> taqleed bhi kar matam bhi kar<br> dushman pe nigahein gehri rakh<br> aye mere baradar e eemani</p> 
  <p>5. Uff tak ki ijazat tujhko nahi<br> maa baap se jab tu baat kare<br> awaaz bhi apni dheemi rakh<br> aye mere baradar e eemani</p> 
  <p>6. Ban sakta nahi qambar, fizza<br> par soch tu hai shia kiska<br> kuch laaj ali o batool ki rakh<br> aye mere baradar e eemani</p> 
  <p>7. Mat radd e amal ki parwah kar<br> ae shaer e haqq Sibt e Jafar<br> tu koshish apni jaari rakh<br> aye mere baradar e eemani</p> 
